  "label": "Nobody Escapes This. Nobody",
  "description": "This phrase is a rhetorical statement used to convey the inevitability of punishment or retribution. In the context of the meme, it is used to emphasize the severity of the execution, implying that no one, not even the most powerful or dangerous, can escape the consequences of their actions. This phrase is often used in political and social discourse to justify extreme measures against perceived enemies.",
